{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50188","headline":"题净眼师房 · 王昌龄","name":"题净眼师房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白鸽飞时日欲斜，禅房寂历饮香茶。\n倾人城，倾人国，斩新剃头青且黑。\n玉如意，金澡瓶，朱唇皓齿能诵经，吴音唤字更分明。\n日暮钟声相送出，袈裟挂着箔帘钉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}